{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b33e0f8e-m03-4c19-9f01-tms-rank",
    "name": "TMS — M03 Ranking & Prioritisation",
    "description": "M03 Ranking & Prioritisation — Node port **3001**, No UI.\n\nAnswers: **in what order should we deliver the qualified work?**\n\n## Pool\nOnly `qual_outcome = QUALIFIED` with non-null `qualified_qty`. Never FLAGGED / PENDING / CANNOT_EVALUATE.\n\n## Score (seed weights 40/25/15/12/8)\n1. RUN_OUT_RISK — `max(0, weight − days × decay)` (seed: 40 − days×7)\n2. ORDER_VALUE — `min(weight, value / divisor)` (seed: /60000)\n3. DROP_SIZE — `min(weight, normalisedQty / divisor)` (seed: /2 in KL)\n4. CUSTOMER_CLASS — catalogue contribution, else I-001 segment fallback (Retail/Port/other)\n5. WINDOW_PRESSURE — mode lookup (WILL_CALL 8, MONITOR 6, SCHEDULED/FORECAST 3)\n\n## Ordering\n- **ADDITIVE** (default publish) — sort by total desc\n- **BAND_THEN_SCORE** — critical → high → medium → low, then total inside band\n\n## Setup\n1. `npm run api:sql` then restart `npm run api`.\n2. Set collection variables `login` and `password`.\n3. Run **Order Intake** + **M02 Qualification** first so QUALIFIED pool is non-empty.\n4. Run folder **0. Login** (saves `token`).\n5. Port **3001**, not 3000. No trailing slash.\n\n## Base path\n`/api/v1/ops/ranking/...`\n\n## Variables saved by scripts\n`token`, `weightSetId`, `runId`, `orderId`, `reorderOrderId`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3001" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "login", "value": "your.email@company.com" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "producttype", "value": "TMS" },
    { "key": "enviroment", "value": "DEV" },
    { "key": "weightSetId", "value": "RWS00001" },
    { "key": "runId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "supersededRunId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "reorderOrderId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "divisionId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Login",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "00 Health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('health ok', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(j.ok).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(j.name).to.eql('tms-api');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "200 `{ ok: true, name: \"tms-api\" }`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "01 Login — get accessToken",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('login returns token', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const token = json.accessToken || json.access_token || json.token;",
                  "  pm.expect(token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', token);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"producttype\": \"{{producttype}}\",\n  \"enviroment\": \"{{enviroment}}\",\n  \"login\": \"{{login}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jwt/login",
            "description": "Saves `{{token}}`. `enviroment` spelling is intentional."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02 GET M02 qualified pool (precheck)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('M02 pool reachable', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json() || {};",
                  "const items = json.items || json || [];",
                  "const list = Array.isArray(items) ? items : [];",
                  "if (!list.length) {",
                  "  console.warn('QUALIFIED pool empty — run M02 qualification first or ranking run returns poolSize 0');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ops/qualification/pool",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "ops", "qualification", "pool"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "divisionId", "value": "{{divisionId}}", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "dueBefore", "value": "2026-12-31", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Membership feed from M02 (unordered). Ranking scores this set — empty pool → empty run."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
